traces.inference_trace:
Values are bounded by 1e5, so I use two Fenwick trees indexed by value: one for counts, one for sums. A queue keeps the last m elements.

**Updates.** When a new element arrives, add it to both trees. If the window then holds more than m elements, remove the oldest one from both trees.

**Query.** The MKAverage is (sum of the smallest m−k elements − sum of the smallest k elements) / (m − 2k).

**Sum of the smallest t elements.** Use a Fenwick descent on the count tree:
- Walk down from the highest power of two, keeping a position `pos`, a running count `cnt` and a running sum `sum`.
- Advance into a node only if doing so keeps the count strictly below t.
- At the end, `pos + 1` is the value v where the t-th smallest element sits.
- The result is `sum + (t - cnt) * (pos + 1)`.

**Performance.** For speed in PHP, I store the trees as plain arrays and keep the oldest element in a ring buffer.

```php
class MKAverage {
    private $m; private $k;
    private $N = 100001;
    private $cntT; private $sumT;
    private $buf; private $head = 0; private $size = 0; private $total = 0;
    private $LOG;

    function __construct($m, $k) {
        $this->m = $m; $this->k = $k;
        $this->cntT = array_fill(0, $this->N + 1, 0);
        $this->sumT = array_fill(0, $this->N + 1, 0);
        $this->buf = array_fill(0, $m, 0);
        $l = 1;
        while ($l * 2 <= $this->N) $l *= 2;
        $this->LOG = $l;
    }

    private function upd($v, $c) {
        $n = $this->N;
        $s = $c * $v;
        for ($i = $v; $i <= $n; $i += $i & (-$i)) {
            $this->cntT[$i] += $c;
            $this->sumT[$i] += $s;
        }
    }

    private function smallest($t) {
        if ($t <= 0) return 0;
        $pos = 0; $cnt = 0; $sum = 0;
        $n = $this->N;
        for ($step = $this->LOG; $step > 0; $step >>= 1) {
            $np = $pos + $step;
            if ($np <= $n && $cnt + $this->cntT[$np] < $t) {
                $pos = $np;
                $cnt += $this->cntT[$np];
                $sum += $this->sumT[$np];
            }
        }
        return $sum + ($t - $cnt) * ($pos + 1);
    }

    /**
     * @param Integer $num
     * @return NULL
     */
    function addElement($num) {
        $this->upd($num, 1);
        $this->total++;
        if ($this->size < $this->m) {
            $this->buf[($this->head + $this->size) % $this->m] = $num;
            $this->size++;
        } else {
            $old = $this->buf[$this->head];
            $this->upd($old, -1);
            $this->buf[$this->head] = $num;
            $this->head = ($this->head + 1) % $this->m;
        }
        return null;
    }

    /**
     * @return Integer
     */
    function calculateMKAverage() {
        if ($this->size < $this->m) return -1;
        $a = $this->smallest($this->m - $this->k);
        $b = $this->smallest($this->k);
        return intdiv($a - $b, $this->m - 2 * $this->k);
    }
}
```

